{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122380/extras/\ub77c\uc774\ube0c\ub7ec\ub9ac_\ub85c\uace0_1280px720px_.png?t=1730930687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Arkadia. Confront evil beings, uncover their schemes, and fight for justice. Strategize, strengthen your characters, and seize victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arkadia is a turn-based strategy simulation game. Control player characters, each with unique personalities, and find the most efficient strategies to win battles within limited action points. Gather resources, gain experience, and upgrade equipment and skills to enhance your characters and expand your strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Storylines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the fallen general Cardenio and embark on a journey of revenge. Throughout your journey, you will face many choices. The choices you make will lead to significant changes in your journey. You can form alliances with companions or fight as a noble wolf... There is no right answer. The path you take will define your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable Character Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Create your own strategy through equipment configuration and skill enhancement. Characters can lead battles in new directions based on the equipment they wear and the skills they enhance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122380?t=1730930687","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122380?t=1730930687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122380/1a1a642b3703ca6d0f4a6141ba9c29c00c2cc5d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730930687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122380/1a1a642b3703ca6d0f4a6141ba9c29c00c2cc5d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730930687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages or may be inappropriate for use in the workplace: frequent violence or gore, general mature content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122380/extras/\ub77c\uc774\ube0c\ub7ec\ub9ac_\ub85c\uace0_1280px720px_.png?t=1730930687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Arkadia. Confront evil beings, uncover their schemes, and fight for justice. Strategize, strengthen your characters, and seize victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arkadia is a turn-based strategy simulation game. Control player characters, each with unique personalities, and find the most efficient strategies to win battles within limited action points. Gather resources, gain experience, and upgrade equipment and skills to enhance your characters and expand your strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Storylines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the fallen general Cardenio and embark on a journey of revenge. Throughout your journey, you will face many choices. The choices you make will lead to significant changes in your journey. You can form alliances with companions or fight as a noble wolf... There is no right answer. The path you take will define your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable Character Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Create your own strategy through equipment configuration and skill enhancement. Characters can lead battles in new directions based on the equipment they wear and the skills they enhance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["NogakKimchi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122380/header.jpg?t=1730930687","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257065397,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065397/movie480.mp4?t=1730918420","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065397/movie_max.mp4?t=1730918420"},"name":"Version_Release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257065397/5f2a3530be713208eb33b7854ef2e2280aa89653/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730918420","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065397/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1730918420","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065397/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1730918420"}}],"name":"Arkadia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700F CPU @ 2.90GHz 2.90GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</